@E_Commerce.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5129

### Products
GET {{E_Commerce.API_HostAddress}}/api/Product
Accept: application/json

### Brands
GET {{E_Commerce.API_HostAddress}}/api/Product/Brands
Accept: application/json

### Types
GET {{E_Commerce.API_HostAddress}}/api/Product/Types
Accept: application/json

### Delivery methods
GET {{E_Commerce.API_HostAddress}}/api/Orders/deliveryMethods
Accept: application/json
